OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy as
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain spread east through
OL,7,Fthe evening and overnight, rain
OL,8,Fbecoming heavy at times. Becoming
OL,9,Fmainly dry by morning with just a few
OL,10,Fshowers remaining.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FBright spells and some
OL,13,Fshowers through the day, some turning
OL,14,Fheavy and thundery in the afternoon
OL,15,Fand early evening. Best of the dry,
OL,16,Fbright weather in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
